 Rentarou getting mad at her is just part of the daily routines. Though somewhat childish, she's frank and upfront about herself that you just can't hate her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Sekai Project"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64671"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca0713d5b8e421414d1d57935a72212c05142e45b4deee863b24ad4a9265d25f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5faa9e015dd1b2a5e30beb5bc0bcbc1b20d619088e09a967e11bc3eb0f131e0d.webp","width":193,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ななひら","creatorId":"vndb:s20399","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20399","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20399","name":"ななひら","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:66729","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c64672","characterName":"サクヤ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c64672"},"originalCharacterName":"サクヤ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The god of the local shrine in Olive Village, as well as a shrine maiden."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she seems irresponsible and apathetic, the truth is no one cares more about Olive Village more than her. Not good at being honest with herself. She loves Kochouran's coffee."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Sekai Project"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64672"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ffdfde6a6667f5ac68b2643126589a628ac0721f2fa8b0cbcba487c90a2fc3c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/i